notes.content:
Hey everyone!

I've heard a lot of kind things about the soundtrack of t&T: Gleipnir and we decided to release it as a DLC, with cool extras added! Check it out here:
https://store.steampowered.com/app/944160/tiny__Tall_Gleipnir_OST__Extras/

Also, I've been working on a first update, fixing some glitches. Here's a more or less reliable changelog:
- Tall no longer takes the little cord at the start of chapter 3 ;
- Phantom sprites in the cave will no longer appear (hopefully) ;
- Various spelling errors fixed ;
- The hot sauce now has a snoop animation when pressing space ;
- A few German spelling errors have been fixed, hopefully one that made the game crash in the water cave under the forest ;
- The bell objective should be properly deactivated when not in use anymore.

If the update broke anything for you, of course, don't hesitate to run to the official forums and tell me all about it, and I'll be happy to help!

Cheers,
pins.
